## 14. Caveats / known risks

### Finding

The phrase `executeAction` can imply real execution.

### Affected surface

Capability Bus contract semantics and future public API expectations.

### Why it matters

A real executor branch would touch service/backend/runtime/worker boundaries. This branch intentionally does not.

### Smallest safe correction

Keep this branch named and documented as `capability-bus-execute-action-contract-v1`, keep modules under `runtime/bus/executeAction/`, and avoid exporting from `runtime.mjs`.

### What still needs verification

After branch upload, direct GitHub branch source should confirm that no public API or runtime/worker files were modified.

